Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.57,0:00:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there are people\Nwho seek freedom in this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.05,0:00:27.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these things shall not\Nvanish from the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.75,0:00:37.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People tell me my head's in the clouds.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.61,0:00:40.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what they say\Nbecause I'm dreaming of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.01,0:00:43.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are the treasure I found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.63,0:00:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So bright, so bold, and so elusive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.77,0:00:48.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to look away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.83,0:00:51.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it's blinding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.97,0:00:55.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are no words to\Ndescribe how I feel inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.81,0:00:58.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really, really stuck on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.23,0:01:02.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.63,0:01:05.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I won't stop till I\Nget there, you will see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.71,0:01:08.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I need to have\Nthe strength to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.99,0:01:11.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live in wonder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.89,0:01:21.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.21,0:01:24.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna share them with\Nyou. Our love's so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.27,0:01:27.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I want.\NTogether we can move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.67,0:01:29.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live how we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.87,0:01:32.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no limit to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.15,0:01:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.65,0:01:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want to live ordinary life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.73,0:01:39.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a chance to live in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.83,0:01:42.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't even want to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.23,0:01:51.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tony's acting as a decoy?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.93,0:01:53.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, he'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.19,0:01:54.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's buying us some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.43,0:01:56.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we've got to hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.23,0:01:58.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take me to Luffy and the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.97,0:02:02.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, but Sanji, I thought\Nyou got shot earlier?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.33,0:02:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.51,0:02:12.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got him, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.75,0:02:15.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And don't worry, he\Nwon't be going anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.47,0:02:17.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.25,0:02:21.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speak up I'm at the front of the big\Ncasino with the alligator on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.01,0:02:23.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And rain base, rain dinners?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.03,0:02:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice job.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.94,0:02:28.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was such a convincing performance\Nthat your boss is on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.79,0:02:31.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should really consider\Na career in acting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.79,0:02:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.70,0:02:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.77,0:02:36.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, um, you're gonna\Nlet me go now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.37,0:02:37.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.11,0:02:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I didn't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.25,0:02:45.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More of those millions creeps\Nare checking out our handiwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.03,0:02:47.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You better get going.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.09,0:02:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what to do, Chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.93,0:02:52.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.41,0:02:55.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Mr. Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.03,0:02:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you see who did this to our friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.11,0:02:59.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.45,0:03:00.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was it you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.49,0:03:01.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you take them down?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.47,0:03:03.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever I can manage.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.73,0:03:06.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.93,0:03:08.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was me, Mr. Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.05,0:03:16.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name's Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.33,0:03:18.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prince, you are Mr. Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.51,0:03:26.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.87,0:03:33.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.39,0:03:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was called Mr. Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.39,0:03:40.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.01,0:03:47.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bridge collapsed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.27,0:03:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The bridge to the casino just collapsed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.49,0:04:08.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how Chopper and\NI did it, more or less.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.09,0:04:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But is Tony going to be alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.17,0:04:14.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that little furball's\Ngot a few tricks up his sleeve.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.43,0:04:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.97,0:04:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you're here somewhere, Mr. Prince.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.09,0:04:29.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I find you, I'm going\Nto introduce you to my hook.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.15,0:04:32.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't notice me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.57,0:04:33.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't notice me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.63,0:04:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't notice me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.47,0:04:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All of us are going to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.41,0:04:40.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The water's going to be up to our neck!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.51,0:04:41.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.87,0:04:43.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.99,0:04:45.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you stupid Katorea!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.93,0:04:47.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're hungry, come and get me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.79,0:04:48.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you nuts, Nami?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.89,0:04:50.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.49,0:04:56.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to lure that Katorea in close\Nenough so he'll bite this cage apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.37,0:04:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.28,0:04:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not a bad idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.29,0:05:00.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, come and get us, you stupid banana!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.75,0:05:01.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You rotten banana!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.53,0:05:05.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, I told you, that\Nthing's not a banana.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.73,0:05:08.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an alligator with a\Nbanana growing out of its head.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.13,0:05:10.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's called a banana Katorea.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.23,0:05:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me explain it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.39,0:05:12.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've heard of the monkey dance, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.95,0:05:13.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't banana!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.57,0:05:16.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up and listen for a second!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.43,0:05:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, look, there's a dance called\Nthe monkey dance, you follow?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.33,0:05:24.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though it's got the word monkey\Nin it, it isn't an actual monkey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.75,0:05:26.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't touch those bars!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.61,0:05:29.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How do you know they're not\Nbananas if you haven't eaten one?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.47,0:05:30.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.13,0:05:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just too tough!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.04,0:05:40.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The banana didn't even ditch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.05,0:05:42.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi, please, hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.19,0:05:45.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.39,0:05:47.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're all about to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.81,0:05:49.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can you just sit there like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.47,0:05:52.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be trying to\Nget us out of here, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.09,0:05:53.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.37,0:05:54.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How much do you guys know?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.13,0:05:57.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What exactly is Crocodile after?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.79,0:06:00.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The woman at Crocodile's side.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.23,0:06:05.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you know the world governments had a\Nsizable price on her head for 20 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.15,0:06:08.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As I recall, over 70 million berries.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.71,0:06:09.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,70 million?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.97,0:06:10.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy Mellow!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.03,0:06:12.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why is it so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.11,0:06:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's almost as much as Crocodile had.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.23,0:06:17.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moment those two joined forces,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.57,0:06:20.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this insurrection became\Nmore than just a simple coup.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.53,0:06:22.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they're not stopped here and now,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.39,0:06:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this could very well turn into something\Nthe whole world would get dragged into.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.11,0:06:27.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whole world?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.45,0:06:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.09,0:06:31.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is starting to sound\Na little far-fetched.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.63,0:06:33.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care if all that is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.39,0:06:38.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, I don't need any other excuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.21,0:06:40.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still gonna kick that guy's ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.03,0:06:45.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I See so how do you\Nintend to get out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.05,0:06:59.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait just tough it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.87,0:07:01.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He says she brings some help back
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.25,0:07:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi, I know you're doing all\Nyou can, but please hurry back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.57,0:07:11.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit, if only my swordsmanship were\Nbetter, I could cut through this stupid cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.71,0:07:12.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'd be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.55,0:07:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's really impolite to make a lot of\Nnoise at mealtime like you were doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.25,0:07:26.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll teach you how to behave.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.33,0:07:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bad manner, kick course!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.39,0:07:59.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey guys, been waiting long?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.01,0:08:02.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jay, it's Mr. Prince!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.59,0:08:04.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're finally gonna get out of here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.71,0:08:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.81,0:08:07.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, don't just stand there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.25,0:08:08.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Find the key and get us out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.75,0:08:09.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mommy, my dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.15,0:08:11.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you love me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.15,0:08:13.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.01,0:08:14.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.92,0:08:18.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'll love you even more if\Nyou hurry up and open this cage!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.61,0:08:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is one lovesick idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.99,0:08:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Phoebe!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.90,0:08:23.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.73,0:08:31.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,More diners with bad manners, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.83,0:08:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get them, Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.15,0:08:36.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smash those weird bananas into pudding!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.87,0:08:44.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, I'm gonna teach these\Nbananas some proper table manners alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.31,0:08:47.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since theirs are so bad they attacked\Na lady, I'll do it the hard way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.87,0:08:51.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take my sweet time doing it\Ntoo, cause nobody does that to Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.85,0:08:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have any time for chivalry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.13,0:08:55.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One second strikes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.25,0:08:57.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, make that one instant strikes!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.85,0:09:00.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The third one who just\Ncame in has the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.75,0:09:02.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, how do you know that, Smokey?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.37,0:09:05.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess your ears aren't\Nas big as your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.89,0:09:09.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't that one's growl the same\Nas the one who swallowed the key?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.59,0:09:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smart thinking collapsing the\Nbridge to buy time like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.25,0:09:15.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are obviously more straw\Nhats here than we thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.87,0:09:19.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that was all done to lure us away\Nso they could rescue their friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.93,0:09:21.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course it was. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.49,0:09:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Key!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.89,0:09:29.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is! Get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.21,0:09:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.75,0:09:35.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That doesn't look like the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.27,0:09:38.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.61,0:09:42.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.69,0:09:46.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, water at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.97,0:09:47.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.71,0:09:49.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, it's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.81,0:09:52.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.87,0:09:54.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Three?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.37,0:09:57.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was he doing in the\Nbelly of a banana Katorea?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.11,0:10:07.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I was a goner, stupid\NCrocodile! So you thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.87,0:10:10.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you could get rid of me but\Nyou didn't try hard enough
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.19,0:10:12.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the moment I was swallowed\NI used the last of my power
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.01,0:10:14.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to create that waxwax ball
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.75,0:10:21.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that was how I survived a key
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.99,0:10:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, why do they want\Nthis key so bad? Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.01,0:10:38.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A room that's surrounded\Nby and flooding with water.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.31,0:10:40.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A cage full of Straw Hats.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.85,0:10:43.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they're screaming\Nlike mad for this key.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.03,0:10:48.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I see what's happening here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.75,0:10:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.66,0:10:50.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Three, I presume. Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.61,0:10:55.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How'd you know who I was?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.77,0:10:57.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, your hairstyle gave it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.01,0:10:59.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.17,0:11:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toss it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.37,0:11:01.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.61,0:11:06.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure thing! Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.83,0:11:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.41,0:11:17.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know who you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.17,0:11:19.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but if you want the Straw Hats\Nout, you're no friend of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.97,0:11:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want the key?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.88,0:11:22.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go find it! Good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.59,0:11:24.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll need it with all\Nthose crocodiles around.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.55,0:11:25.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.19,0:11:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.69,0:11:30.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what happens if\Ntheir rescuer is able to
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.05,0:11:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ascertain which banana\NKatorea swallowed the key?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.49,0:11:38.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, well, even if they were able to get\Nthe key, it wouldn't make any difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.77,0:11:40.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had the real one with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.57,0:11:42.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The key in the gator's belly's a fraud,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.55,0:11:45.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that's for me to know\Nand them to find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.27,0:11:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.41,0:11:47.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.69,0:11:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He might be good for something, like\Nusing those wax powers to make a key.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.97,0:11:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.69,0:12:08.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice work, Candleman.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.37,0:12:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now there are just two more things to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.25,0:12:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.16,0:12:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.17,0:12:22.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.08,0:12:24.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to stop the rebels\Nbefore they attack Alubarna.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.13,0:12:26.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should be able to get\Nout through that hallway.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.43,0:12:27.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a problem with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.91,0:12:29.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Namely, dozens of banana-gators.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.67,0:12:32.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.71,0:12:35.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can take on hundreds\Nof those weird bananas!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.69,0:12:39.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, that problem solved.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.73,0:12:42.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I had so much trouble\Nwith just one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.69,0:12:44.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, don't be so hard on yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.61,0:12:46.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those two just have\Ncrazy abnormal strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.91,0:12:47.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.82,0:12:50.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be even stronger if I\Nwasn't soaked right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.25,0:13:05.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.16,0:13:06.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This place is falling apart!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.53,0:13:07.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we can see that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.59,0:13:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.59,0:13:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The passageway's probably due!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.51,0:13:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got to get out of here right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.13,0:13:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.04,0:13:28.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hats time to pay if\Nthe banana gators haven't
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.83,0:13:31.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,finished you off yet You'll\Nwish they had by the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.53,0:13:32.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm done with you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.25,0:13:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be
Dialogue: 2,0:13:39.42,0:13:42.38,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\bord0\fnPristina\frz336.7\fscx128\fscy153\c&H000000&\pos(703.985,598.333)\frx10\fry356}Catch you later,\Nyou damn gator.
Dialogue: 3,0:13:39.42,0:13:42.38,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\bord0\fnPristina\c&H000000&\frz336.7\fscx128\fscy153\4a&HFF&\pos(703.985,598.333)\frx10\fry356}Catch you later,\Nyou damn gator.
Dialogue: 2,0:13:39.42,0:13:42.38,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\bord0\fnPristina\frz334.9\fscx137\fscy219\c&H000000&\pos(625.246,817)\frx-1\fry353\fax0.05}~Mr. Prince
Dialogue: 3,0:13:39.42,0:13:42.38,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\bord0\fnPristina\c&H000000&\frz334.9\fscx137\fscy219\4a&HFF&\pos(625.246,817)\frx-1\fry353\fax0.05}~Mr. Prince
Dialogue: 1,0:13:39.42,0:13:42.38,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(0,0)\fscx100\fscy100\p1\c&HEBEBE7&\3c&HE9EBE8&\blur1}m 254 771 l 476 827 528 779 873 894 1121 451 745 296 531 316
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.21,0:13:59.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you alive there, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.63,0:14:04.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp, please wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.63,0:14:07.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, just kick your legs or something!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.39,0:14:09.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, help us pull you out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.63,0:14:14.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Geez, why would a pirate want devil\Nfruit powers if it means he can't swim?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.19,0:14:19.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Smoker!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.83,0:14:21.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zoro, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.35,0:14:23.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In case you forgot, that guy's our enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.65,0:14:24.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back off!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.56,0:14:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't want to do it, but he\Nwas about to die, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.33,0:14:30.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.24,0:14:31.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta get moving, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.57,0:14:33.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've lost too much time already.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.29,0:14:35.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi, can we still make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.29,0:14:37.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.37,0:14:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.28,0:14:41.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You still have that perfume I bought you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.01,0:14:44.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Yeah. But why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.47,0:14:46.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put some of it on, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.71,0:14:48.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.62,0:14:51.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, just one whiff of it makes me\Nswoon like a schoolboy in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.85,0:14:54.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did not intend to make\Nyou act like an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.33,0:14:59.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you save my life?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.45,0:15:24.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro, quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.71,0:15:26.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta save Smokey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.11,0:15:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.02,0:15:27.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's our enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.94,0:15:28.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can take care of himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.85,0:15:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, he can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.76,0:15:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got Devil Fruit\Npower, so he can't swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.57,0:15:34.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll drown if you don't help him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.31,0:15:37.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For crying out loud, Luffy,\Ndo I really have to do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.87,0:15:38.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.51,0:15:44.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I did was follow my\Ncaptain's orders, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.81,0:15:47.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, wouldn't read too much\Ninto it if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.99,0:15:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was one of his crazy\Nwhims, pay it no mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.43,0:15:57.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you wouldn't have any gripes with me\Ncarrying out my duties and arresting you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.73,0:15:58.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.64,0:16:00.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, I knew this was a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.51,0:16:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is what you get for saving a marine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.15,0:16:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.06,0:16:10.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Straw Hat Pirates? Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.15,0:16:13.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it looks like they have\NCaptain Smoker surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.41,0:16:15.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not for long, they won't. No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.21,0:16:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.37,0:16:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.41,0:16:22.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Full speed ahead to Alubarna!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.01,0:16:24.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.21,0:16:25.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me at him!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.53,0:16:28.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finally awake, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.17,0:16:37.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want some of this? Bring it on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.23,0:16:39.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Smoker!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.43,0:16:41.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.39,0:16:42.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's just get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.30,0:16:43.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.22,0:16:45.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should, but you just saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.71,0:16:52.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This way! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.13,0:17:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.37,0:17:08.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the only time I'm\Nletting you Straw Hats off.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.37,0:17:09.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.57,0:17:12.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When we next meet, it's\Ngoing to be his enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.37,0:17:24.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There they are!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.11,0:17:27.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.89,0:17:32.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reinforcements have\Narrived, Captain Smoker!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.15,0:17:32.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.69,0:17:35.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let them escape! Cut them off!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.41,0:17:38.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's our cue.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.41,0:17:42.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Vivi, which way to Alubarna? That way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.45,0:17:45.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Due east across the\Ndesert! They're running!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.21,0:17:46.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.99,0:17:48.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.13,0:17:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.04,0:17:49.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aren't you coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.96,0:17:50.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.83,0:18:00.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They won't escape us, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.85,0:18:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.76,0:18:06.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not such a bad guy, Smokey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.21,0:18:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you get the hell out of here, Frye!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.01,0:18:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Captain Smoker!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.79,0:18:34.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't let those pirates get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.27,0:18:58.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.47,0:19:00.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After them!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.53,0:19:18.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, aren't you coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.35,0:19:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.53,0:19:24.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm tired. You're tired? Listen. Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.17,0:19:26.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no point pursuing them now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.91,0:19:28.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have the men call off the chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.49,0:19:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want everyone assembled here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.79,0:19:35.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And contact headquarters.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.11,0:19:39.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell them to mobilize every military\Nvessel in the vicinity and route them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.13,0:19:40.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want Alabasta surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.21,0:19:43.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're calling for reinforcements, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.67,0:19:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.63,0:19:45.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if I may point out,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.83,0:19:47.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,our superiors may not\Nbe willing to move that
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.67,0:19:50.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,many ships against such a\Nsmall number of pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.49,0:19:53.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since when do I care what\Nthe superiors might think?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.25,0:19:55.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.27,0:19:56.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get right on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.35,0:19:58.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.26,0:20:00.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pursuit has been\Ncalled off! Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.11,0:20:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.77,0:20:19.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.45,0:20:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The scent of Nami's perfume is\Ngetting stronger and stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.13,0:20:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.04,0:20:28.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please tell me you guys aren't planning\Nto run all the way to Alubarna!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.57,0:20:29.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've got eyelash!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.05,0:20:32.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just where the hell is\Nthat stupid camel anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.65,0:20:33.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Close, I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.01,0:20:35.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't this town have a stable?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.65,0:20:36.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's get some horses!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.63,0:20:41.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the whole town is crawling\Nwith marines! Not to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.59,0:20:42.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.97,0:20:45.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guys, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.55,0:20:49.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A crab?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.55,0:20:53.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jumper, that's a moving crab.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.89,0:21:07.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jumby.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.45,0:21:09.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, awesomeness!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.57,0:21:11.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe my eyes.?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.21,0:21:13.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet it's delicious! I'll abide!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.07,0:21:15.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We get to ride it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.03,0:21:19.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pleased to meet ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.35,0:21:21.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it just me or does its\Nface look kind of shady?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.55,0:21:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.46,0:21:23.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least we have a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.07,0:21:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.98,0:21:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's Eyelash's friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.11,0:21:33.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eyelash has lots of friends in this\Narea because it's his hometown.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.71,0:21:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was born and raised here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.31,0:21:37.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's nice, but kind of pervy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.35,0:21:39.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you found one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.05,0:21:42.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moving crabs are always\Nsubmerged under the sand,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.41,0:21:44.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it's nearly impossible to spot one.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.47,0:21:47.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Judging by his size, I'd\Nsay this guy's pretty fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.37,0:21:49.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, time to move out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.61,0:21:50.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.95,0:21:52.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.57,0:22:07.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chopper, stop the crab!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.91,0:22:15.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.19,0:22:23.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.89,0:22:25.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That damn idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.55,0:22:26.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.81,0:22:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You guys go on ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.15,0:22:32.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.09,0:22:45.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure you deliver Vivi home!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.67,0:22:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Safe and sound, you have to promise me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.77,0:22:53.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good luck, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.03,0:22:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.71,0:22:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go, Chopper.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.15,0:23:02.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just keep going to Alubarna. Right. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.45,0:23:04.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, crab!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.07,0:23:07.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.31,0:23:09.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, Zoro! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.63,0:23:11.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's cold! Stop the crab!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.01,0:23:13.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We gotta go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.75,0:23:14.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all right, Vivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.11,0:23:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.02,0:23:17.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to trust me on this, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.65,0:23:19.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I certainly feel sorry for the other guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.99,0:23:21.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy shows no mercy to his prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.47,0:23:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there's not a single person he's\Ngone after that was able to walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.45,0:23:27.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crocodile will fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.75,0:23:28.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy will win.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.19,0:23:30.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.53,0:23:36.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moment that the Rebel Army started\Nrunning, this land's final hour was set.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.05,0:23:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once the Royal Army and the\NRebel Army meet, this country,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.97,0:23:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Kingdom of Alabasta,\Nwill be gone forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.47,0:23:48.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you truly are the one and only\Nhope for preventing that tragedy,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.31,0:23:50.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then you must survive, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.05,0:23:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, from this moment forward,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.23,0:23:59.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what happens to Luffy, or any of us for\Nthat matter, isn't the least bit important.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.67,0:24:02.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.43,0:24:08.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi, this is a fight that\Nyou and you alone started.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.01,0:24:13.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who bravely left\Nthis land years ago and made
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.19,0:24:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the decision to stand up against\Na corrupt and evil organization.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.81,0:24:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, don't make the mistake\Nof thinking you're alone anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.93,0:24:28.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's right! Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.59,0:24:31.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because, because Captain\NUsopp is going to protect you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.91,0:24:33.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.37,0:24:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.28,0:24:40.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be waiting for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.27,0:24:42.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be in our moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.75,0:24:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.71,0:24:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could say Princess Vivi\Nslipped through our fingers.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.85,0:25:03.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter, the agents are still\Nscheduled to gather in Alubarna.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.37,0:25:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Contact them at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.09,0:25:14.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, I'd say you've taken\Nthis nonsense a little too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.41,0:25:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.32,0:25:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi doesn't see it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.87,0:25:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, unlike most people, she\Ngenuinely cares about others.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.75,0:25:28.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess deep down she's an optimist.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.09,0:25:29.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if it's not too realistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.19,0:25:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take this revolt, for example.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.09,0:25:34.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She believes no one needs to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.29,0:25:35.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nobody needs to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.09,0:25:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The problem with idealistic fools\Nlike Princess Vivi is they take a
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.77,0:25:44.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stand without any comprehension of\Nwhat is truly involved in a real fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.73,0:25:45.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.25,0:25:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.63,0:25:52.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't change the fact\Nthat as long as you're around,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.01,0:25:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi's gonna fight until she\Neither wins or dies trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.09,0:26:01.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I figure, I'll take\Nyou down right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.91,0:26:06.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such a foolish boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.23,0:26:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Despite what the idealists cry\Nabout, there's one constant truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.15,0:26:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the rough battlefields of\Nlife, you either kill or die.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.43,0:26:17.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm more than happy to shoot a
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.47,0:26:20.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,bullet through every\Nbleeding heart I meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.89,0:26:24.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, which proves you're\Nthe bigger fool here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.57,0:26:31.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you think something's funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.39,0:26:33.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,perhaps you'd like to die as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.89,0:26:38.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,nico robin if you want\Nto try go right ahead and
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.59,0:26:40.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,didn't you promise not\Nto call me by that name?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.87,0:26:42.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.53,0:26:45.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm headed to Alubarna see you there?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.45,0:26:48.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,damn woman i'll never figure her out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.59,0:26:53.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i've got three minutes to spare.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.27,0:26:58.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.31,0:27:01.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm certain your time\Nwill have run out as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.33,0:27:11.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's your move, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.43,0:27:14.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with pleasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.63,0:27:18.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.59,0:27:19.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pistol!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.63,0:27:34.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.55,0:27:50.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By now it should be quite\Nobvious, but I'll warn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.11,0:27:55.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You cannot defeat me. This is\Nan exercise in utility. Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.51,0:27:57.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.25,0:28:17.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen to my warning and take heed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.99,0:28:20.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you continue this senseless attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.37,0:28:22.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will have accomplished nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.19,0:28:24.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and wasted what little time you have left.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.99,0:28:51.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good critics, you lousy old sandgator!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.77,0:28:56.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wasting your time, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.35,0:28:59.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.77,0:29:02.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how hard you\Nfight against the truth,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.33,0:29:06.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no way a rubber freak like\Nyou could even hope to rival me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.23,0:29:11.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, my fist interrupted you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.79,0:29:12.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, what was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.19,0:29:25.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had my fill of your\Npathetic fun and games.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.75,0:29:29.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's end this, now. Fun and games!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.25,0:29:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me, I'm dead serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.33,0:29:32.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.24,0:29:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit, he's right, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.55,0:29:35.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got an answer for all of my attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.95,0:29:37.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do I do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.57,0:29:41.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We may both be pirates, but you\Nfall grossly short on skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.99,0:29:43.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Desert Spada!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.25,0:29:57.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice reflexes, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.05,0:30:01.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A full-on hit from that\Nattack would have killed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.93,0:30:03.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.13,0:30:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's one deep hole!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.37,0:30:10.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You may have Devil Fruit powers, but\Nyou lack discipline and training.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.65,0:30:13.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With that, your skills could\Nbe as formidable as any.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.31,0:30:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you're not there yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.97,0:30:18.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like so many fools, you waste time\Nobsessing over your abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.19,0:30:22.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gimmicks get you only so far in a fight\Nwithout the skill sets to back them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.11,0:30:28.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Desert Gyrosol!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.59,0:30:41.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the...?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.75,0:30:43.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.31,0:30:50.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sand!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.51,0:30:51.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's sinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.71,0:30:52.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.25,0:30:58.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this stuff? Let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.35,0:30:59.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.26,0:31:00.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me out!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.18,0:31:01.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me out! What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.09,0:31:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never heard of quicksand?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.61,0:31:05.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It makes for a convenient\Ndesert burial when
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.51,0:31:07.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you need to get rid of someone in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.63,0:31:10.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sand is drawn down\Ninto underground waterways,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.59,0:31:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I have the good fortune of being\Nable to detect exactly where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.47,0:31:19.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That advantage alone is enough to make me\Nunbeatable when fighting in the desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.79,0:31:27.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you think I'm going to let myself\Nbe buried alive in this sand trap,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.21,0:31:29.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you've got another thing coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.35,0:31:30.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.85,0:31:32.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.13,0:31:41.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I can't flunk you, then\Nmaybe I could catch you instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.17,0:31:43.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gone, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.81,0:31:50.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you learned anything,\Nmoron, predictable?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.61,0:31:52.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut up, gum -
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.07,0:31:57.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is really getting old.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.47,0:32:01.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,LET ME GO!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.38,0:32:02.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm flying you!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.79,0:32:03.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,CHRISTEN CUTLIN
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.61,0:32:09.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.52,0:32:10.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,MY ARM!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.49,0:32:17.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.07,0:32:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all shriveled up like a mummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.85,0:32:22.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You turned my arm into a mummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.61,0:32:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop whining.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.52,0:32:24.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the price you pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.11,0:32:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sand has absorbed all\Nthe moisture from your arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.95,0:32:28.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.11,0:32:31.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I decided to attack was your arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.35,0:32:35.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can do this all day long,\Nuntil you're a pile of dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.47,0:32:39.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gotta be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.43,0:32:42.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it! Water!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.79,0:32:50.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All in vain.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.35,0:32:52.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're wrong, Sandy!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.25,0:32:56.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, that old guy in Yuba\Ngave me this barrel of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.05,0:32:59.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He spent all night\Ndigging it up just for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.27,0:33:01.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, here, take this with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.11,0:33:04.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's not scared and neither am I!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.63,0:33:09.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not about to give in to\Nthe sand without a fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.11,0:33:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.19,0:33:13.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is getting ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.47,0:33:15.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My spine!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.21,0:33:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.29,0:33:24.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This fails now!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.21,0:33:31.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vermin, it is time to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.91,0:33:34.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Both you and the accursed land of Yuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.97,0:33:37.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your three minutes are up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.05,0:33:42.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I said at the start, I don't have\Ntime to fool around with you any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.69,0:33:45.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Sables!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.65,0:34:05.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, the sand so soothing and dry.
Dialogue: 1,0:34:05.75,0:34:08.67,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.3\fad(550,0)\fs120\fnChinacat\fsp6\bord3.1\pos(720,727.4)\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(505,550,\1a&H00&)}Rainbase
Dialogue: 2,0:34:05.75,0:34:08.67,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.3\fad(550,0)\fs120\fnChinacat\fsp6\bord0\pos(720,727.4)\c&HE6E6E6&\4a&HFF&}Rainbase
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.29,0:34:07.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look out! Sandstorm!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.81,0:34:09.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right ahead in the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.15,0:34:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take shelter!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.11,0:34:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.02,0:34:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's not coming this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.71,0:34:13.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's headed south!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.63,0:34:16.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain Smoker, look! Up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.11,0:34:23.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi! What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.97,0:34:26.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a giant storm\Nmoving toward Rain Base!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.05,0:34:29.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Crocodile!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.89,0:34:33.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.03,0:34:43.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.07,0:34:45.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can you hear it move?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.37,0:34:49.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this land, the prevailing winds\Nalways blow from north to south.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.57,0:34:50.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.73,0:34:55.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if this infantile sandstorm of mine\Nwere to, say, catch one of these winds,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.15,0:34:58.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it would grow exponentially\Nuntil it became a monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.09,0:35:01.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And following its trajectory south,\Nwhere do you think it would strike?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.97,0:35:02.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.53,0:35:05.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then Yuba.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.95,0:35:10.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not there!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.65,0:35:14.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit, why the hell are\Nyou doing this? Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.55,0:35:17.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it started.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.45,0:35:18.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's headed south.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.79,0:35:22.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That nice old man has nothing\Nto do with this, you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.77,0:35:25.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop it or I swear I'll\Nkill you, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.77,0:35:29.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You leave that old man alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.81,0:35:37.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You cannot alter fate. That sandstorm\Nis going to pick up strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.19,0:35:42.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And eventually it will become strong\Nenough that even I can't stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.13,0:35:44.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe you! Liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.41,0:35:47.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yuba is finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.17,0:35:48.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't end this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.51,0:35:49.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.83,0:36:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you really think you were my equal?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.05,0:36:11.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There have been any number of rookies\Nlike you who've challenged me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.21,0:36:14.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you've all shared a common\Ntrait, fatal ineptitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.23,0:36:21.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And in the end, the only thing you\Nare truly qualified for is death.

